nfft
------------------------------------------
The NFFT is a C subroutine library for computing the nonequispaced discrete
Fourier transform (NDFT) in one or more dimensions, of arbitrary input size,
and of complex data.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfftw3-devel-3.3.11-1
  libfftw3-omp3-3.3.11-1
  libfftw3_3-3.3.11-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libnfft3-devel-3.6.0-1bl1
  libnfft3_4-3.6.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  CUnit-2.1.3-1
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libfftw3-devel-3.3.11-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://www-user.tu-chemnitz.de/~potts/nfft/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/NFFT/nfft/releases/download/3.6.0/nfft-3.6.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nfft-3.6.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nfft-3.6.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nfft-3.6.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nfft-3.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnfft3_4-3.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnfft3-devel-3.6.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(nfft)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/nfft.README
  /usr/share/doc/nfft/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/nfft/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/nfft/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/nfft/README.md

(libnfft3_4)
  /usr/bin/cygnfft3-4.dll
  /usr/bin/cygnfft3_omp-4.dll
  /usr/bin/cygnfft3_threads-4.dll

(libnfft3-devel)
  /usr/include/nfft3.h
  /usr/include/nfft3mp.h
  /usr/lib/libnfft3.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libnfft3_omp.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libnfft3_threads.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/nfft3.pc

